        owl:versionInfo        "3";
        skos:altLabel          "";
        skos:definition        "A sediment leaching treatment designed to release elements classified as being in 'carbonate' and in 'surface associations' with phases such as hydrous iron and manganese oxides, clays and organic matter (stage 2 in Chester et al 1988 https://doi.org/10.1016/0304-4203(88)90036-9)."@en;
